      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763306741281,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🌱 1. What is Spring?\n\n💡 A big framework for building Java applications (web apps, security, data, etc.)\n\nBUT…\n\nIt requires a lot of configurations\n\n1.You need to set up XML or Java config manually\n\n2.No server included — you must deploy WAR file in Tomcat manually\n\n3.You have to configure dependencies yourself\n\n4.Example (Spring WITHOUT Boot)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🌱 1. What is Spring?\n\n💡 A big framework for building Java applications (web apps, security, data, etc.)\n\nBUT…\n\nIt requires a lot of configurations\n\n1.You need to set up XML or Java config manually\n\n2.No server included — you must deploy WAR file in Tomcat manually\n\n3.You have to configure dependencies yourself\n\n4.Example (Spring WITHOUT Boot)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "l6qSCaIn0ZdN1oUlQzPFH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 523.5392054357047,
      "y": 518.8280684063177,
      "width": 803,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
