      "seed": 704193517,
      "version": 46,
      "versionNonce": 1521197187,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763807605179,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🚀 2. What is Spring Boot?\n\n💡 A tool built on top of Spring that makes Spring MUCH easier.\n\nSpring Boot adds:\n\n✔ Auto-configuration\n\nNo need to write thousands of lines of config.\n\n✔ Embedded server\n\nTomcat/Jetty starts automatically.\nJust run your program → your app runs.\n\n✔ Starter dependencies\n\nInstead of manually adding 20 JARs for Spring MVC, you add:\n\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>\n    <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-web</artifactId>\n</dependency>\n\n\nThis one dependency brings everything you need.\n\n✔ Production-ready features\n\nHealth checks, metrics, monitoring, etc.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🚀 2. What is Spring Boot?\n\n💡 A tool built on top of Spring that makes Spring MUCH easier.\n\nSpring Boot adds:\n\n✔ Auto-configuration\n\nNo need to write thousands of lines of config.\n\n✔ Embedded server\n\nTomcat/Jetty starts automatically.\nJust run your program → your app runs.\n\n✔ Starter dependencies\n\nInstead of manually adding 20 JARs for Spring MVC, you add:\n\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>\n    <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-web</artifactId>\n</dependency>\n\n\nThis one dependency brings everything you need.\n\n✔ Production-ready features\n\nHealth checks, metrics, monitoring, etc.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
