      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763810995756,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Meaning:\n\nSpring Boot automatically scans the package of your main class + all\nsubpackages.\n\nSo even if you do NOT write @ComponentScan, Spring Boot already does\nit.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Meaning:\n\nSpring Boot automatically scans the package of your main class + all subpackages.\n\nSo even if you do NOT write @ComponentScan, Spring Boot already does it.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
