    {
      "id": "1Q_zexKZcQkcbC2-OiegG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 383.76003860563173,
      "y": 29288.693510445733,
      "width": 867.1032294950979,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bRS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1809849805,
      "version": 87,
      "versionNonce": 1699926093,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763819011587,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Steps for XML-Based Spring Configuration:\n \n1. Create XML Configuration file: \n\nCreate an XML configuration file in the src/main/resources directory. This \nfile will define the beans that the Spring container will manage. \ne.g., Spring.xml file in the src/main/resources\n\n \n2. Define Beans in XML: \n⭐Beans are objects that form the backbone of a Spring application. They \nare managed by the Spring IoC (Inversion of Control) container. \n\nEach bean is defined using the <bean> tag in the XML configuration file.  \n● id: A unique identifier for the bean, which is used to reference it. \n● class: The fully qualified class name of the bean.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Steps for XML-Based Spring Configuration:\n \n1. Create XML Configuration file: \n\nCreate an XML configuration file in the src/main/resources directory. This \nfile will define the beans that the Spring container will manage. \ne.g., Spring.xml file in the src/main/resources\n\n \n2. Define Beans in XML: \n⭐Beans are objects that form the backbone of a Spring application. They \nare managed by the Spring IoC (Inversion of Control) container. \n\nEach bean is defined using the <bean> tag in the XML configuration file.  \n● id: A unique identifier for the bean, which is used to reference it. \n● class: The fully qualified class name of the bean.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wwsdn1j66nvCyZSstUt9W",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 400.25941565214384,
