      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763826882852,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We got 19 for both the object \nbut we know that an object is refrence\nto a class and each object have its own \nclass copy and the properties and method \nthat class has ,every object create there\nown copy and keep it isolated from other \nobject so fro stu1 we should get 19 and \nfor stu2 we should get 0 (Default value)\ncause we didnt set any",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We got 19 for both the object \nbut we know that an object is refrence\nto a class and each object have its own \nclass copy and the properties and method \nthat class has ,every object create there\nown copy and keep it isolated from other \nobject so fro stu1 we should get 19 and \nfor stu2 we should get 0 (Default value)\ncause we didnt set any",
