      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763827254394,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In this example both stu4 and stu5 \npoints to same reference instead of \ncreating there own refrence which make sense\ncause to create them we didn't use new()\nkey word to allocate the memory to that\nobject instead we pointed stu4 and stu5\nto same memory",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
