      "originalText": "i)update the spring.xml file:\nSyntax\n<bean id=\"beanId\" class=\"ClassName\">\n    <property name=\"propertyNameInClass\" value=\"\"/>\n</bean>\n\nThis is how we inject a primitive type value in bean object\n    ",
