      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Well done but now let's see how we can inject non primitive type ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Well done but now let's see how we can inject non primitive type ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OLHOab5vLCGnTyDQf-0Ma",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 574.5277454527045,
      "y": 45261.310616815295,
      "width": 704,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1692348739,
      "version": 52,
      "versionNonce": 1296672333,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763840606563,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Setter Injection in Spring Core (Beginner Friendly Explanation +\nExamples)\n\nSetter Injection means:\n\nSpring injects the dependency using a setter method instead of a\nconstructor.\n\nThis is useful when:\n\n*The dependency is optional\n\n*The dependency might change at runtime\n\n*You don’t want mandatory dependencies in the constructor",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Setter Injection in Spring Core (Beginner Friendly Explanation + Examples)\n\nSetter Injection means:\n\nSpring injects the dependency using a setter method instead of a constructor.\n\nThis is useful when:\n\n*The dependency is optional\n\n*The dependency might change at runtime\n\n*You don’t want mandatory dependencies in the constructor",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mGW3LzibEQA7Z_MyWuBzY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 564.7576443263672,
      "y": 45727.0488183236,
      "width": 671,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1894272067,
      "version": 37,
      "versionNonce": 1959261795,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763840629298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Setter Injection Using XML (Spring Core)\nStudent.java\npublic class Student {\n\n    private Laptop laptop;\n\n    public void setLaptop(Laptop laptop) {   // SETTER METHOD\n        this.laptop = laptop;\n    }\n\n    public void code() {\n        laptop.compile();\n    }",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Setter Injection Using XML (Spring Core)\nStudent.java\npublic class Student {\n\n    private Laptop laptop;\n\n    public void setLaptop(Laptop laptop) {   // SETTER METHOD\n        this.laptop = laptop;\n    }\n\n    public void code() {\n        laptop.compile();\n    }",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "H8NpkyXtIKR34FkTl-Ukb",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 544.4689522918576,
      "y": 45706.22915185587,
      "width": 790.9587898635867,
      "height": 370.06585593040654,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
